1
00:00:00,033 --> 00:00:02,303
PENNY (on TV):
Doctor, please help me.

2
00:00:02,302 --> 00:00:06,102
(Penny(on television):)I think I might be turning
into a killer gorilla.

3
00:00:06,106 --> 00:00:08,976
DOCTOR:
Why do you think you're turning
into a killer gorilla

4
00:00:08,976 --> 00:00:10,706
(Doctor:)and not just a regular gorilla?

5
00:00:10,711 --> 00:00:14,211
PENNY:
Because regular gorillas
are vegetarians,

6
00:00:14,214 --> 00:00:16,614
(Penny(on television):)and I just bit the fingers
off your receptionist!

7
00:00:16,617 --> 00:00:17,947
(Penny screeching like an ape;
chaotic clattering)

8
00:00:17,951 --> 00:00:20,851
(Penny:)Okay, we've seen
plenty.
No!

9
00:00:20,854 --> 00:00:22,054
(Bernadette:)Give me the remote.

10
00:00:22,055 --> 00:00:24,825
(Amy:)Careful. She'll bite
your fingers off.

11
00:00:24,825 --> 00:00:26,895
(Penny:)Okay, well, I've been
poking around the internet,

12
00:00:26,894 --> 00:00:29,894
(Penny:)and I think I found something
we'll enjoy watching even more.

13
00:00:29,897 --> 00:00:30,897
(Amy:)What is it?

14
00:00:30,898 --> 00:00:31,868
(Penny:)Oh, just a video

15
00:00:31,865 --> 00:00:34,035
(Penny:)of Bernadette
in a beauty pageant.

16
00:00:34,034 --> 00:00:34,904
What?!

17
00:00:34,902 --> 00:00:36,672
(Bernadette:)Okay, I learned my lesson.

18
00:00:36,670 --> 00:00:38,770
Making fun of people is wrong!

19
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:41,210
(Amy:)I haven't learned
my lesson.

20
00:00:41,208 --> 00:00:43,278
Play it! Play it!

21
00:00:45,379 --> 00:00:49,049
(applause)

22
00:00:49,049 --> 00:00:52,689
(Bernadette(on screen):)Hi. I'm Bernadette Maryann
Rostenkowski

23
00:00:52,686 --> 00:00:55,926
(Bernadette(on screen):)from Yorba Linda, California.

24
00:00:57,190 --> 00:01:01,430
(laughing): You look like
a talking cupcake!

